            {
                "entry_id": "ed4c0471-6e7f-3446-ba59-83bd059df29b",
                "word": "pédophilie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "14aba68b-cef6-4a30-a4e8-13977b213fb2",
                        "entry_id": "ed4c0471-6e7f-3446-ba59-83bd059df29b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pédophilies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db79e7d3-9c02-3a22-8b74-05834c6f695c",
                        "entry_id": "ed4c0471-6e7f-3446-ba59-83bd059df29b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Attirance sexuelle, pathologique et criminelle, envers les personnes impubères ou en début de puberté, qui domine la sexualité d'un individu."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c038e745-6b11-46ae-982d-6b486b27d078",
                                "sense_id": "db79e7d3-9c02-3a22-8b74-05834c6f695c",
                                "text": "[…], Mgr Scicluna, promoteur de justice de la Congrégation pour la doctrine de la foi, parlait à propos de l'ensemble des affaires d'abus sexuels impliquant un prêtre de « 10 % de cas de pédophilie au sens strict et de 90 % de cas qu'il convient davantage de qualifier d’éphébophilie, dont 60 % concernant des individus de même sexe et 30 % étant de caractère hétérosexuel »."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17cf8e51-5b6f-4d10-ae2e-5d230078b8a8",
                                "sense_id": "db79e7d3-9c02-3a22-8b74-05834c6f695c",
                                "text": "[Lewis Carroll] Personne n’eût osé accuser de pédophilie ce diacre austère qui ne se plaisait que dans la compagnie des petites filles, à qui il racontait des histoires merveilleuses qu’il illustrait par la suite."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a1e0ae9-9b61-41da-a4a8-1c9d5c15071f",
                                "sense_id": "db79e7d3-9c02-3a22-8b74-05834c6f695c",
                                "text": "Or, c’est bien ça le nœud du problème de la pédophilie dans l’Église catholique: ce n’est pas qu’il y ait des prêtres pédocriminels mais qu’ils aient été couverts continûment par leurs supérieurs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b6c157f-f996-4628-ac87-17532b2194a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed4c0471-6e7f-3446-ba59-83bd059df29b",
                        "source_sense_id": "db79e7d3-9c02-3a22-8b74-05834c6f695c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Pädophilie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Pädophilie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab96447d-4c4b-3496-9e01-755f7c6a2a41",
                                        "entry_id": "18b4be1d-b9a7-3cff-8711-479602b3db05",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sexuelle Neigung Erwachsener zu Kindern und Jugendlichen vor Erreichen der Pubertät"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12351ec6-85cc-4662-b7aa-1a6b11b2ebd7",
                                                "sense_id": "ab96447d-4c4b-3496-9e01-755f7c6a2a41",
                                                "text": "„Pädophilie ist die häufigste der inkriminierten sexuellen Abweichungen und macht 25 – 30 % aller Sexualdelikte aus (Schorsch u. Pfäfflin 1994).“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4d78567-08f2-4e6d-9aa5-7f615ec5a9ca",
                                                "sense_id": "ab96447d-4c4b-3496-9e01-755f7c6a2a41",
                                                "text": "„Ziel ist nicht, wie Laien oft denken, die vollkommene Heilung von abnormen sexuellen Verlangen wie der Pädophilie, die in der Medizinersprache als Paraphilie zusammengefasst ist.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11a13a20-becb-4621-866d-4ec6ff9a1e3f",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed4c0471-6e7f-3446-ba59-83bd059df29b",
                        "source_sense_id": "db79e7d3-9c02-3a22-8b74-05834c6f695c",
                        "target_lang_word": "pedophilia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pedophilia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "275adc07-16a4-30bc-a72c-b3bb7951fd85",
                                        "entry_id": "3ccb97b9-a387-39c9-909b-39c99613aaf3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual attraction by adults and adolescents to children, specifically prepubescent children."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9f41e35-efb9-4fff-a503-f06d3efd6e95",
                                                "sense_id": "275adc07-16a4-30bc-a72c-b3bb7951fd85",
                                                "text": "As noted earlier, pedophilia was cited as both an aggravating and a mitigating circumstance by trial judges, as was the absence of pedophilia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d522a833-dfac-460a-8590-8dcc11c6d889",
                                                "sense_id": "275adc07-16a4-30bc-a72c-b3bb7951fd85",
                                                "text": "Sometimes a man with pedophilia is content to stroke the child's hair, but he may also manipulate the child's genitalia, [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2f98342-9be2-36fc-8e27-947ebb0e3b53",
                                        "entry_id": "3ccb97b9-a387-39c9-909b-39c99613aaf3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual activity between adults and children; the act of child molestation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "proscribed",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebced1ce-e2d4-43e6-b33a-dda7d33f3067",
                                                "sense_id": "c2f98342-9be2-36fc-8e27-947ebb0e3b53",
                                                "text": "Fifteen months later, a committee of the congregation found that he had sexually abused several boys within the congregation. […] The fact that Alger committed pedophilia at the age of thirty-four casts a shadow over his subsequent yearning for relationships with boys and young men, but there is no evidence of any later misconduct."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff9b67a2-b23f-43f3-af4a-1dc6cc820f97",
                                                "sense_id": "c2f98342-9be2-36fc-8e27-947ebb0e3b53",
                                                "text": "Entire books have been written about the role of scandal in US politics (Garment, 1992). Offenses include smoking marijuana, hiring illegal aliens, plagiarizing, sexually harassing others, engaging in pedophilia, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78c28a19-f523-49c6-b9b9-2dc6710a3384",
                                                "sense_id": "c2f98342-9be2-36fc-8e27-947ebb0e3b53",
                                                "text": "It's quite another (a bad idea) to expect amateurs to figure out who is telling the truth about Iraq, or which priests have committed pedophilia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "217c0a65-399f-4628-9797-55ef356a7522",
                                                "sense_id": "c2f98342-9be2-36fc-8e27-947ebb0e3b53",
                                                "text": "Although the Holy See publicly expressed its rejection of sexual abuse and pedophilia and expressed its commitment to cooperate with civil authorities when cases of pedophile priests were found¹², there are no known cases of bishops or cardinals, being found responsible for abusing children or covering up for pedophilia in their parishes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f9c96a00-5efe-45d5-9a59-0ee4109f9635",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed4c0471-6e7f-3446-ba59-83bd059df29b",
